          "text": "3-29-2025"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi User,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I’ve been thinking about your questions, not that I have actual answers, but I think that I want the website with image by an artist whose work covers two of my books, Alexis Peskine, but something faint in the background. Here are a couple of examples:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://octobergallery.co.uk/shop/index.php?route=product/product&path=33&product_id=145](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__octobergallery.co.uk_shop_index.php-3Froute-3Dproduct_product-26path-3D33-26product-5Fid-3D145&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=E9Ya_DfAFFsXjX_YviT-XrzkFrWtCk7xs_tXhOmHTzw&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://c8.alamy.com/comp/PRH021/somerset-house-london-uk-3-october-2018-1-54-contemporary-african-art-fair-opens-4-7-october-2018-image-mixed-media-portrait-by-alexis-peskine-created-from-nails-of-differing-gauges-hammered-into-wood-october-gallery-stand-credit-malcolm-parkalamy-live-news-PRH021.jpg](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__c8.alamy.com_comp_PRH021_somerset-2Dhouse-2Dlondon-2Duk-2D3-2Doctober-2D2018-2D1-2D54-2Dcontemporary-2Dafrican-2Dart-2Dfair-2Dopens-2D4-2D7-2Doctober-2D2018-2Dimage-2Dmixed-2Dmedia-2Dportrait-2Dby-2Dalexis-2Dpeskine-2Dcreated-2Dfrom-2Dnails-2Dof-2Ddiffering-2Dgauges-2Dhammered-2Dinto-2Dwood-2Doctober-2Dgallery-2Dstand-2Dcredit-2Dmalcolm-2Dparkalamy-2Dlive-2Dnews-2DPRH021.jpg&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=pCMAsFbwiV1DUCAxXgZANXwTM_zQMh4U7fzUTyZcfeM&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The second one is actually one of my former students."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I’m also thinking of the Eiffel Tower, something futuristic for the tab about my summer program: [https://fr.pinterest.com/pin/1067634655459512453/](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__fr.pinterest.com_pin_1067634655459512453_&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=qrTuB1ToezFyii6c2jzEFmOrwj0e_iFBRgTERKcXk1w&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://fr.pinterest.com/pin/899031144358170815/](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__fr.pinterest.com_pin_899031144358170815_&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=7yKiQe2SqpPRn0-hggsgGKqO0SEX7Wc63BK3Jm6db70&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In terms of quotes, phrases anchoring me these days:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "James Baldwin: “I can't be a pessimist because I am alive. To be a pessimist means that you have agreed that human life is an academic matter. So, I am forced to be an optimist. I am forced to believe that we can survive, whatever we must survive.”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Maya Angelou -  *On the Pulse of Morning*:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*Here on the pulse of this new dayYou may have the grace to look up and outAnd into your sister’s eyes,Into your brother’s face, your countryAnd say simply,Very simply,With hope,Good morning.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There were no films from the Paris Noir, but this image from the expo is powerful and dates from the 1960s, I think: [https://galeriebabylone.com/app/uploads/Nicolas-Silatsa-Parinoir-1981-2.jpg](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__galeriebabylone.com_app_uploads_Nicolas-2DSilatsa-2DParinoir-2D1981-2D2.jpg&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=vFHFfcVpRo19nC4D-gMOpvZHOKqh6aufWTlLA4nEAlU&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There were others but using them would be costly. And, if my body of work were a physical space, it would either be a museum, but not as a graveyard to dead artists, but a living breathing space filled with works that are the newspapers of their day. Or, a spaceship – I love science fiction – or the way that NASA shows us space in all is majesty and mystery, especially what the Hubble has shown us:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://science.nasa.gov/mission/hubble/science/universe-uncovered/](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__science.nasa.gov_mission_hubble_science_universe-2Duncovered_&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=OTKGxMO54eAm_bFScPAyghtnwb6X-FkNaKqxR2n2ROo&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://fr.pinterest.com/pin/142567144444402591/](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__fr.pinterest.com_pin_142567144444402591_&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=9m4q-xCLFznZNohW5krgur60LBjOnxSRbYaKNTjDbK8&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://fr.pinterest.com/pin/650207264969596206/](https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__fr.pinterest.com_pin_650207264969596206_&d=DwMGaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=pUbrNVx4da6zor52wU18Cytg2D4Ra8CvsoroGyElRms&m=R6IXpIUWmv3AipeDQrY9ESUxzEUTnBy7yvC0ho-Tcc-xMlwu9-yJXuKRj4DUWX7_&s=6c3Ad26l04rCE0BPJ2vv_ZmZt57Gkp6Bor8t-ttwiXI&e=)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Texture and tone, not sure what you mean, but we can talk about that tomorrow and music. I added some work from Coltrane and Hartman that I’ve been listen to lately, and am interested in exploring more Future Flavors with Terri Lyne Carrington."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Okay, think that should get us going."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "See you tomorrow,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Trica"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}